---

<section class="testimonials">
  <h2>What parents say</h2>
  <div class="testimonials-grid">
    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        "Learning baby massage gave me so much more confidence in understanding my baby's cues. 
        It's become a special part of our bedtime routine."
      </p>
      <p class="testimonial-author">— Sara, Waiheke Island</p>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        "The classes were so relaxed and supportive. My baby seemed much more settled after we 
        started the massage routine."
      </p>
      <p class="testimonial-author">— Emma, Waiheke Island</p>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        "I loved that both my partner and I could attend. It's something we both do with our baby now, 
        and it's really strengthened our bond as a family."
      </p>
      <p class="testimonial-author">— James, Waiheke Island</p>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        "Millie was so patient and understanding when my baby needed to feed or sleep during class. 
        I never felt pressured, and the techniques really work."
      </p>
      <p class="testimonial-author">— Rachel, Waiheke Island</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials {
    padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .testimonials h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }

  .testimonials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .testimonial-card {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, white 80%, var(--sw-rose));
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--sw-ink) 10%, transparent);
  }

  .testimonial-text {
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .testimonial-author {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .testimonials-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>

